ally really amplifies the power  of the technique there's a really good  clip of Joe Rogan talking about this and  trying to teach it to somebody on his  podcast who was struggling to understand  it and so if you want to see that clip  so it's just something like Joe Rogan  sidekick do with stretching it's just  you just haven't thrown a sidekick in a  while now extend extend extend straight  don't look over your stomach look over  your shoulder like that that's how you  look so yes I lift this knee up here and  turning it over the shoulder almost  looking like over my right shoulder so  you can you see my face is actually  behind the shoulder here and I'm looking  at the target of the kick then as I  bring this back up as well I'm nice and  unbalanced as I'm able to reset the  equilibrium of my weight coming back up  and then drop him down nice and lightly  without slamming my foot down which is  another issue that you often tend to see  people do is we'll go from this position  and then they will tend to slum this leg  down into the ground and then they'll  all of their central gravity will be  forwards so this is essentially the side  kicking technique if you've understood  this first part and are able to do it  well then all of the other things you do  like any stretching or any exercises to  increase your strength and explosiveness  we're only gonna make that better  however if you were to do those without  understanding this kick it's not gonna  really matter you don't want a crappy  explosive kick you know the me no we're  super high kick with poor technique it's  about having the technique first and  then being able to build on it after  that thanks once again guys I hope this  video is useful for you and if you have  any questions don't hesitate to send me  a message on any of my social media  links and also be sure to subscribe to  my youtube channel as I'm gonna start to  be creating a lot more content on there  as I mentioned in the last video thanks  ve